    "id": "thm:all-test-converse",
    "kind": "theorem",
    "statement": "Theorem 4. For fixed \\(H\\), every \\(\\varepsilon\\in(0,1-\\alpha)\\), every \\(r\\), every \\(\\phi\\in\\Psi_{\\alpha,r}\\), and every \\(\\delta_{\\mathrm{sq}}\\ge0\\) satisfying \\(\\sqrt{\\delta_{\\mathrm{sq}}}\\le\\sqrt{\\varepsilon}L_H(V^{\\mathrm{quad}}_r)^{1/4}\\), \\[\\inf_{\\beta\\in\\mathcal B_{1,r}(H,\\delta_{\\mathrm{sq}})}\\mathbb E_{Z,U}(\\phi\\mid\\beta)\\le\\alpha+\\varepsilon.\\] Here \\(L_H=\\{h^2/(C_{\\cos}\\xi_Hv_H)\\}^{1/4}\\) is computed from the same \\(2^h\\)-row assignment table and optimized motif variance program as the upper statistic.",
    "free_symbols": [
      "H",
      "alpha",
      "epsilon",
